      "content": "It is completely understandable that feeling like withdrawing allows you to finally pause the suffering, as escaping the cycle of pain often feels like the only mercy left. However, true resilience is found not in disappearing from the world, but in choosing how you engage with it and protecting your inner peace from their chaos. You are more than your circumstances, and the people who win because they rule themselves do not define your worth or your right to live.",
